---

<section id="top" class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <div
    class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl border-surface-border px-6 md:border-x"
  >
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl pb-24 pt-24 text-center sm:pt-32">
      <span
        class="animate-rise inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-solid! border-surface-border bg-surface px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-wide text-text-secondary"
      >
        VENTURE STUDIO
      </span>

      <h1
        class="animate-rise mt-6 text-balance text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-text-primary sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl"
        style="animation-delay: 90ms"
      >
        Bâtir les infrastructures financières <span class="gradient-text"
          >qui résistent</span
        > là où le reste échoue.
      </h1>

      <p
        class="animate-rise mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed font-light text-text-secondary sm:text-lg"
        style="animation-delay: 180ms"
      >
        Lehmora Labs bâtit l'infrastructure financière des marchés émergents :
        tontines, frais scolaires, abonnements partagés, décisions du
        quotidien. Des logiciels souverains, conçus pour tenir la charge
        plutôt que la démo.
      </p>

      <div
        class="animate-rise mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row"
        style="animation-delay: 270ms"
      >
        <a
          href="#portfolio"
          class="w-full rounded-md bg-lehmora px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-lehmora/90 sm:w-auto"
        >
          Explorer le portfolio
        </a>
        <a
          href="#contact"
          class="w-full rounded-md border border-solid! border-surface-border px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-text-primary transition-colors hover:border-text-muted sm:w-auto"
        >
          Contacter le studio
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
